B.aKK=new A.er("tut_let_stewards_work","Let the Stewards Work","Enable Autobuild on a province (or in Autobuild Settings). Your reeves will then spend within a budget so you need not micromanage.",A.bt4(),"Wessex's reeves took the ledger in hand.",15,null)
B.aKH=new A.er("tut_raise_a_jewel","Raise a Jewel","Use Develop Province to raise one shire to development 7. Development lifts every yield and unlocks extra building slots.",A.bt6(),"A shire of Wessex flourished above its fellows.",20,null)
