B.bbT=new A.P("Light raid, heavy raid or full pillage:"," the harder you strike, the more gold and the more ruin. It takes the army's whole turn, and starts a war if you were not at war.")
B.bbW=new A.P("Danegeld:"," when the Danes are much stronger than you and their hosts stand at your border, they demand half your treasury (at least 100 gold) for 8 turns of peace. It only buys time: when the peace runs out, they come back. East Anglia, the land they came for, is never offered terms. Playing the Danes, you can demand Danegeld yourself.")
