B.bcA=new A.P("Build:"," a Farm makes the population grow faster, a Market or Port brings gold, and so does a Mine where there is ore (the highlands, Cornwall, parts of Wales, the Pennines and the Mendips: +10 gold a turn); a Barracks lets you recruit there, and a Fortification makes the province hard to take.")
