B.bcG=new A.P("Walls:"," assault a fortified province (its defenders fight 30% harder per wall level), or besiege it \u2014 it falls in a few turns if your army stays beside it. Besieging a realm you are at peace with is war.")
B.bcH=new A.P("When you are attacked,"," SALLY OUT is your charge, and ABANDON gives up the province to save your men: its levies fall back to a neighbouring province you hold.")
B.bcJ=new A.P("","You lose if another realm wins first, or if you lose all your land and armies. The panel at the top left shows how far you have come and the rival closest to winning.")
B.bcL=new A.P("","Each turn is one season, four to a year, starting in spring 793.")
B.bcM=new A.P("AT PEACE",B.z)
B.bcO=new A.P("","Your starting provinces also build on their own, with part of your spare gold.")
