B.bcP=new A.P(B.m4,B.m2)
B.bcQ=new A.P("Every realm can sail."," A host with ships, on the coast and not yet moved this turn, can sail to a coast within reach and march, attack or pillage there. The voyage takes its whole turn. One ship is enough, and a beaten host with ships that has nowhere to fall back to on land escapes by sea.")
