B.bcW=new A.P("Leave at least one man behind.",B.N)
B.bcX=new A.P("Battles are live."," Troops and morale fall round by round. CHARGE! is a gamble: it can break a wavering enemy, but against a strong, steady line many of your men fall. Pulling back is free before the lines meet (CALL OFF) and costly after (RETREAT). A side whose morale reaches zero breaks and is cut down.")
